title: notes I imagine being helpful
pid: 085d0a0f-d872-4ca3-9292-2d1e0a9d1e25
body: |2-
  - who am I
  - what has happened
  - how to cooperate
    - with <person>
  - what I have read
    Since what there is to know is large,
    reductions in your graph will probably be useful.
    Each mind probably will want to dstill complex topics
    into their graph in a unique way,
    based on what they specifically consider
    most important. But sharing notes is, I suspect,
    powerful too -- see docs/forking.org.
